OL,3,ALibya's top religious authority rules
OL,4,Aagainst wearing Nike clothes
OL,5,
OL,6,FLibya is home to the ancient Greek city
OL,7,Fof Cyrene, where archaeological remains
OL,8,Finclude a statue of the Greek goddess
OL,9,Fof the same name.
